      "width": 1260,
      "height": 32,
      "text": "10 ms / 20 ms / 30 ms timers produce INFO + PASS pairs. Each INFO includes callbackEpochMs and sequence number to distinguish script timing from GUI receipt timing.",
      "value": 0,
